WEBVTT

00:00:08.860 --> 00:00:11.400
"Kodomo no Odocha"

00:00:11.570 --> 00:00:13.740
That rumor that I love you

00:00:14.320 --> 00:00:17.330
is true, yes it is.

00:00:18.700 --> 00:00:20.870
You can't ignore it either.

00:00:23.080 --> 00:00:25.460
Whether you're awake or asleep,

00:00:25.960 --> 00:00:29.090
please don't be embarrassed.

00:00:34.300 --> 00:00:36.640
Is it a sin if I sneak into your heart

00:00:37.140 --> 00:00:40.350
by ridding you...

00:00:41.390 --> 00:00:43.520
...of your other love?

00:00:45.900 --> 00:00:48.110
At sunset,

00:00:48.730 --> 00:00:50.610
when the children go home,

00:00:50.820 --> 00:00:54.530
Today's incident is burning love!

00:00:54.700 --> 00:00:58.450
You can tell it accurately.

00:00:58.740 --> 00:01:00.540
7 O'Clock News!

00:01:00.870 --> 00:01:04.330
Please, our relationship...

00:01:05.370 --> 00:01:09.960
Please don't blame it on the true kiss

00:01:10.130 --> 00:01:11.800
In a city without light,

00:01:12.460 --> 00:01:15.680
let's burn the fire of love.

00:01:16.760 --> 00:01:19.100
Don't be so easy going

00:01:19.180 --> 00:01:21.390
The existence is a mistake

00:01:21.760 --> 00:01:24.890
You're asking for something not there.

00:01:32.320 --> 00:01:33.780
I'm Kurata Sana,

00:01:33.780 --> 00:01:37.490
a 6th grader and TV personality
affiliated with Gekidan Komawari.

00:01:37.490 --> 00:01:40.660
My beloved Mama is a famous novelist,
who has even won the Aoki Laureate Prize.

00:01:40.660 --> 00:01:42.490
The chipmunk on her head
is Maro-chan.

00:01:42.490 --> 00:01:44.250
My former boyfriend,
Sagami Rei-kun.

00:01:44.250 --> 00:01:47.670
Right now, he's earnestly on the way
to becoming a fine manager.

00:01:47.670 --> 00:01:50.000
The mysterious
white frog straight man.

00:01:50.000 --> 00:01:52.670
I'm Babbit-ribbit.
Hey, I'm no frog.

00:01:52.670 --> 00:01:54.670
Hayama Akito,
my natural enemy.

00:01:54.670 --> 00:01:58.680
Even so, right now, when I'm around him,
I'm relaxed for some reason.

00:01:58.680 --> 00:02:02.430
The handsome and gifted child actor
and trumpeter, Naozumi-kun.

00:02:03.680 --> 00:02:07.390
"Kiss! Fight!
Karate and Trumpet"

00:02:07.480 --> 00:02:08.980
"Safety first"

00:02:19.030 --> 00:02:20.700
Nice! Nice!

00:02:20.700 --> 00:02:22.120
Sure enough,
when you put up a tree,

00:02:22.120 --> 00:02:26.370
--that feeling that Christmas
is almost here swells up inside!
--I appreciate you going to all
that trouble. Thank you so much.

00:02:26.370 --> 00:02:29.170
By the way, Onda-san,
any Christmas Eve plans?

00:02:29.250 --> 00:02:29.960
"Phew"

00:02:29.960 --> 00:02:32.290
That's right when
the Sensei's deadline is.

00:02:32.290 --> 00:02:35.630
I- is that right?
That's too bad, huh?

00:02:35.630 --> 00:02:40.300
No, this goes with the job.
What about you, Sagami-san?

00:02:40.300 --> 00:02:42.800
Oh, I have a date planned!

00:02:42.800 --> 00:02:43.640
Although,

00:02:43.640 --> 00:02:46.310
having a date on Christmas Eve means
that anywhere we go, it will be packed.

00:02:46.310 --> 00:02:50.980
I know it sounds trite, but she keeps
badgering me, so what can I do, you know?

00:02:50.980 --> 00:02:53.310
How nice for you to be
in such high spirits.

00:02:53.310 --> 00:02:55.400
Nah, I wouldn't say
I'm high-spirited...

00:02:57.990 --> 00:02:59.650
You are high-spirited!!

00:02:59.650 --> 00:03:04.660
Say, Shimura-san, could you bake
a great big huge cake for Christmas Eve?

00:03:05.990 --> 00:03:07.790
A "great big huge" one?

00:03:07.790 --> 00:03:10.000
Mm-hmm, after all, this year's
party is going to be...

00:03:10.000 --> 00:03:11.670
"Xmas"

00:03:10.000 --> 00:03:11.670
...a Christmas Eve plus...

00:03:11.670 --> 00:03:14.670
...middle birthday
double-celebration!

00:03:14.670 --> 00:03:16.670
Middle birthday?

00:03:16.670 --> 00:03:19.340
Allow me to explain
it to you in song!

00:03:19.340 --> 00:03:21.340
♪ Hayama's birthday is October 12th, ♪

00:03:21.340 --> 00:03:23.340
♪ while mine is on March 7th. ♪

00:03:23.340 --> 00:03:27.680
♪ Make the middle-middle-middle day
one that is happy and lucky, ♪

00:03:27.680 --> 00:03:30.600
♪ and guess what,
it falls on Christmas Eve! ♪

00:03:30.600 --> 00:03:34.270
Oh, my! In that case, I'll have to put
everything I've got into making a big feast!

00:03:34.270 --> 00:03:36.650
Yeah! Yeah! Let's do that!
Let's do that!

00:03:36.650 --> 00:03:40.610
Sana, I found the decorations
for the tree in the storeroom.

00:03:40.610 --> 00:03:45.620
Yay! Is the tinsel in here?
Tinsel! The tree has to have tinsel!

00:03:45.660 --> 00:03:48.330
Huh? The Tanabata festival
decorations are in here, too.

00:03:48.330 --> 00:03:52.330
Oh well, let's use both to decorate
the tree! We're double-celebrating!

00:03:52.330 --> 00:03:53.620
Can I help, Sana?

00:03:53.670 --> 00:03:56.960
Sensei...

00:03:56.960 --> 00:03:59.960
What about your work?

00:04:02.930 --> 00:04:07.930
Relax. It may be about a week too soon,
but here's your present.

00:04:08.680 --> 00:04:11.640
Y- you don't mean...
you don't mean...

00:04:11.640 --> 00:04:15.310
you don't mean
you're already done!?

00:04:15.310 --> 00:04:16.690
Open it and see.

00:04:16.690 --> 00:04:17.860
Okay!

00:04:20.440 --> 00:04:23.030
"Wrong"

00:04:23.030 --> 00:04:25.870
Wrong!

00:04:25.870 --> 00:04:26.950
Sensei!

00:04:29.370 --> 00:04:30.450
Oh, yeah.

00:04:30.450 --> 00:04:34.120
Sana-chan, I've gotten you a job
doing a new commercial for Heal-Band.

00:04:34.120 --> 00:04:36.130
If it's Heal-Band,
does that mean...

00:04:36.130 --> 00:04:38.130
You'll be working
with Naozumi-kun again.

00:04:38.130 --> 00:04:42.130
Yay! Together with Naozumi-kun!
Together with Naozumi-kun!

00:04:42.130 --> 00:04:46.970
--That's not all! This commercial is going
to have Director Tarantaru shooting it!
--I can't wait to work together
with Naozumi-kun! I can't wait-

00:04:46.970 --> 00:04:49.640
Tara-? I do like tarachiri
("cod stew"), and all...

00:04:49.640 --> 00:04:53.640
Tarantaru. He's the super-famous
Hollywood movie director.

00:04:53.640 --> 00:04:55.850
"Director Tarantaru is this man."

00:04:55.850 --> 00:04:59.150
Hi! I'm Tarantaru!

00:04:59.150 --> 00:05:03.570
Tarantaru loves Japan's anime
and kappamaki sushi rolls!

00:05:03.570 --> 00:05:05.660
Are you sure
this guy's name isn't Sam?

00:05:05.660 --> 00:05:06.660
Zing!

00:05:08.740 --> 00:05:10.330
Today's another happy day
of work on "Child's Toy."

00:05:10.330 --> 00:05:15.790
--Hey, Yoko-chan, how are you?
What are you doing for Christmas?
--I'm going to bang out
some good work today.

00:05:17.330 --> 00:05:22.340
I see. You've got plans, huh?
That's too bad. Well, anothuh time, then.

00:05:23.670 --> 00:05:25.010
Up next is Noriko-chan, huh?

00:05:25.010 --> 00:05:26.010
Zenjiro-sensei!

00:05:26.010 --> 00:05:28.010
Oh, it's you,
Sana-chan.

00:05:28.010 --> 00:05:29.550
What are you up to?

00:05:29.550 --> 00:05:34.270
Isn't it obvious!? It's awlmost Christmas!
And Christmas means a date!

00:05:34.270 --> 00:05:38.270
I wind up my sideboins extra-coily,
wear the suit I keep in resoive,

00:05:38.270 --> 00:05:40.610
and go out to eat with a goil!

00:05:40.610 --> 00:05:42.610
Do you have anyone
to go out with?

00:05:42.610 --> 00:05:46.950
No, which is why
I'm looking right now.

00:05:46.950 --> 00:05:49.950
"Zenjiro's Secret Addrresses"

00:05:46.950 --> 00:05:49.950
It's for times like this that I put
togethuh these goils' phone numbuhs!

00:05:49.950 --> 00:05:52.950
--What the-?
--With this many numbuhs,
I'm shua to find someone!

00:05:52.950 --> 00:05:55.960
Noriko? It's me,
it's me. Zenjiro.

00:05:55.960 --> 00:05:57.960
You don't know me?
Remembuh, eight years ago, in Kyoto?

00:05:57.960 --> 00:05:59.790
--Sana-chan!
--You're married?

00:05:59.790 --> 00:06:01.420
--Naozumi-kun!
--You're Higashiyamato now?

00:06:01.420 --> 00:06:03.960
--Hey, what work are you doing here today?
--Oh, you mean you're Sane-yan's wife?

00:06:03.960 --> 00:06:05.970
I'm shooting a drama.

00:06:05.970 --> 00:06:09.300
Say, did you hear about
Director Tarantaru's commercial?

00:06:09.300 --> 00:06:11.970
Mm-hmm! I'm looking
forward to it, you know?

00:06:11.970 --> 00:06:12.970
R- really?

00:06:12.970 --> 00:06:16.310
Of course I am.

00:06:16.310 --> 00:06:19.310
Why are you turning red,
Kamura Naozumi?

00:06:19.310 --> 00:06:22.650
We'll understand why later on.

00:06:22.650 --> 00:06:23.940
By the way, Sana-chan,

00:06:23.940 --> 00:06:26.650
if you wouldn't mind, how about
going out with me on Christmas Eve?

00:06:26.650 --> 00:06:30.620
Sorry. I'm glad you asked me,
but I'm throwing a party at my house.

00:06:30.620 --> 00:06:31.620
Party?

00:06:31.620 --> 00:06:36.620
If you like, why don't you come too,
Naozumi-kun? Christmas plus middle birthday.

00:06:36.620 --> 00:06:38.960
Middle birthday?
Whose?

00:06:38.960 --> 00:06:42.290
Hayama's and mine.

00:06:42.290 --> 00:06:44.960
You know Hayama, right?
From my class?

00:06:44.960 --> 00:06:45.960
Mm-hmm.

00:06:45.960 --> 00:06:49.300
Let me think a little while longer about
whether or not I can come to your party.

00:06:49.300 --> 00:06:51.010
Uh-huh, think about it,
think about it.

00:06:51.010 --> 00:06:53.640
But come anyway, okay?
I'll be looking for you.

00:06:53.640 --> 00:06:58.480
Sana-chan, here you are!
You've got to get to makeup!

00:06:58.480 --> 00:07:00.650
Okay, see you when we shoot
that commercial, okay?

00:07:00.650 --> 00:07:02.730
--Mm-hmm.
--Rei-kun, sorry to keep you waiting!

00:07:07.320 --> 00:07:10.990
--Hoy! Hoy! Hoy! Here's your invitation
to my Christmas plus middle birthday party!
--Thank you, Sana-chan.
--Wonder what I should wear?

00:07:10.990 --> 00:07:12.660
Come, okay? Okay?
Everyone come, okay?

00:07:12.660 --> 00:07:16.330
Come, if you like. But do any bullying,
and you'll have to leave at once, got it?

00:07:16.330 --> 00:07:17.330
Yeah.

00:07:17.330 --> 00:07:21.330
--So, she was serious about
throwing this middle birthday?
--Your tickets, your tickets!
You can come with anyone you like!

00:07:21.330 --> 00:07:23.670
Hey! Hey! Hey! Hey! Hey!

00:07:23.670 --> 00:07:26.670
I am a girl who is always serious!
But more importantly, Hayama,

00:07:26.670 --> 00:07:29.340
in addition to the Christmas presents
that we'll all be exchanging,

00:07:29.340 --> 00:07:33.930
make sure you bring another one
to give me just for our middle birthday.

00:07:33.930 --> 00:07:36.260
--Got it? Got it?
--What a drag.

00:07:36.260 --> 00:07:37.520
Say, Akito-kun,

00:07:37.560 --> 00:07:41.270
I'm going to go buy a present for Aya-chan,
so why don't you come with me?

00:07:41.270 --> 00:07:42.350
Yeah.

00:07:43.600 --> 00:07:46.940
Ah, what would be good?
I just don't know.

00:07:46.940 --> 00:07:50.610
Wow! Hey, Akito-kun,
this is really cute!

00:07:50.610 --> 00:07:51.950
Anything's fine.

00:07:51.950 --> 00:07:53.110
Akito-kun!

00:07:53.110 --> 00:07:57.280
A present is something you have to put
your whole heart into when choosing!

00:07:57.280 --> 00:07:58.450
Yeah, yeah.

00:08:03.540 --> 00:08:05.960
Middle birthday...

00:08:05.960 --> 00:08:08.750
Sana-chan, do you really
feel that way about Hayama?

00:08:11.970 --> 00:08:12.930
Stop!

00:08:25.310 --> 00:08:28.980
It's Kamura Naozumi! Hey, Akito-kun,
that's Kamura Naozumi!

00:08:28.980 --> 00:08:33.570
He's coming this way! What do we do?
What do we do? What do we do, Akito-kun?

00:08:33.570 --> 00:08:35.280
Hey.

00:08:35.280 --> 00:08:36.950
H- hey.

00:08:36.950 --> 00:08:39.620
I knew that I would have to ask you
directly about this sometime or other...

00:08:39.620 --> 00:08:41.620
Yes, yes, what about?

00:08:41.620 --> 00:08:43.960
Are you seeing Sana-chan?

00:08:46.290 --> 00:08:49.960
Oh, dear! To be asked
such a thing again!

00:08:49.960 --> 00:08:52.800
W- well, how about it,
Akito-kun?

00:08:52.800 --> 00:08:54.050
Not really.

00:08:55.970 --> 00:08:58.970
In that case, I'll be declaring
my feelings to Sana-chan very soon.

00:08:58.970 --> 00:09:01.220
Eh!? Declaring your feelings!?

00:09:03.980 --> 00:09:05.560
That's okay, right?

00:09:12.320 --> 00:09:15.990
Oh, this is so cute! You think Tsuyoshi-kun
will like something like this?

00:09:15.990 --> 00:09:18.990
That's more something
you would like, Aya-chan.

00:09:18.990 --> 00:09:21.950
You can tell? Say, Sana-chan,
have you decided?

00:09:21.950 --> 00:09:23.950
Yeah, on Hayama's present?

00:09:24.000 --> 00:09:27.580
Nope, not yet.
This sure is hard to do, huh?

00:09:27.580 --> 00:09:30.590
For one thing, I'm not
even sure what he likes.

00:09:30.590 --> 00:09:34.920
This is Hayama's room.
There might be some hints hidden in here.

00:09:34.920 --> 00:09:37.260
Does he like motor sports?

00:09:37.260 --> 00:09:40.260
He does have a video deck,
but he doesn't seem all that into it.

00:09:40.260 --> 00:09:42.100
Hmm, what is this
little ornament?

00:09:42.100 --> 00:09:44.430
Eh!? Declaring your feelings!?

00:09:45.100 --> 00:09:47.100
--That's right, I'm declaring my feelings.
--Somehow, I get the feeling that
something like this just happened.

00:09:47.100 --> 00:09:50.270
--That's okay, since you said
you weren't seeing her, right?
--Maybe it's just déjà vu.

00:09:50.270 --> 00:09:53.280
Even if they aren't seeing each other,
they've still been through a lot!

00:09:53.280 --> 00:09:54.610
Like a naked picture,

00:09:54.610 --> 00:09:56.280
and bungee jumping,

00:09:56.280 --> 00:09:57.950
and after-school class,

00:09:57.950 --> 00:10:00.280
as well as...
as well as...

00:10:00.280 --> 00:10:01.620
a kiss!

00:10:01.620 --> 00:10:06.290
That was something the girls told me
was one-sided, on Hayama-kun's part.

00:10:07.960 --> 00:10:10.130
But still-!

00:10:10.130 --> 00:10:12.420
Say something here,
Akito-kun!

00:10:16.970 --> 00:10:19.140
I...

00:10:19.140 --> 00:10:23.640
...know... her secret.

00:10:23.640 --> 00:10:26.140
I know Sana-chan's
secret as well.

00:10:28.980 --> 00:10:32.860
I'm winning.

00:10:31.150 --> 00:10:32.900
"Hayama's imagination"

00:10:33.900 --> 00:10:36.900
What? What?
What secret, you two?

00:10:36.900 --> 00:10:41.660
Well, the past aside,
what's more important is the future.

00:10:41.660 --> 00:10:44.620
Both Sana-chan and I are striving
to make our name in the world

00:10:44.620 --> 00:10:46.910
by steadily finding new work.

00:10:46.910 --> 00:10:49.250
But what about you?

00:10:49.250 --> 00:10:52.920
Akito-kun is also making
a name for himself in the world!

00:10:52.920 --> 00:10:54.590
I've started taking karate.

00:10:54.590 --> 00:10:56.510
Karate is something strong!

00:10:56.510 --> 00:10:59.260
Not like the ridiculous poo-poo sounds
that come from a trumpet!

00:10:59.260 --> 00:11:01.430
Do not look down
on the trumpet!

00:11:08.100 --> 00:11:11.270
The trumpet is stronger
than karate!

00:11:11.270 --> 00:11:12.270
What?

00:11:12.270 --> 00:11:13.650
They're done talking!

00:11:13.730 --> 00:11:16.940
"World's first!
Karate vs. trumpet"

00:11:14.610 --> 00:11:16.940
Karate vs. trumpet!

00:11:16.940 --> 00:11:18.940
Huh? You're asking
if there can be such a fight?

00:11:18.940 --> 00:11:20.950
It's happening right here,
so yes, there can be!

00:11:29.290 --> 00:11:30.960
Fight!!

00:11:30.960 --> 00:11:35.290
Ease your body into it, keeping your head
directly above your hind end.

00:11:35.290 --> 00:11:39.300
Keep your arm at your side,
make a tight fist, and twist as you...

00:11:39.300 --> 00:11:40.970
Strike! Strike! Strike! Strike!

00:11:40.970 --> 00:11:41.800
Whoa!

00:11:41.800 --> 00:11:44.300
Sure enough, karate is at an advantage,
while the trumpet is at a disadvantage!

00:11:44.300 --> 00:11:46.640
But wait,
the trumpet is rallying!

00:11:48.310 --> 00:11:50.640
Oh, this is a white-hot battle
between differing fighting styles!

00:11:50.640 --> 00:11:52.690
Either side could win this,
and it wouldn't be surprising!

00:11:55.310 --> 00:11:57.940
Oh, my! A policeman's
whistle has now broken in!

00:11:57.940 --> 00:12:00.650
Will this make it
a three-way battle!?

00:12:00.650 --> 00:12:03.660
That's a warning!
Stop it, you guys!

00:12:03.660 --> 00:12:06.660
Huh? They're stopping?
What about the three-way battle?

00:12:06.660 --> 00:12:08.450
Look around you!

00:12:12.000 --> 00:12:14.170
Please excuse us.

00:12:15.330 --> 00:12:19.000
I'll just say
one last thing.

00:12:19.000 --> 00:12:23.010
Sana-chan should be calling off
your middle birthday party.

00:12:23.010 --> 00:12:25.340
W- why is that!?

00:12:25.340 --> 00:12:29.310
Because I'm going to be kissing
Sana-chan very soon.

00:12:31.640 --> 00:12:32.980
K- k- k-

00:12:32.980 --> 00:12:35.310
Kissing him!?

00:12:35.310 --> 00:12:38.320
You mean, me and Naozumi-kun!?

00:12:38.320 --> 00:12:39.980
That's right...

00:12:39.980 --> 00:12:42.950
Ah, w-what do we do?

00:12:44.660 --> 00:12:46.820
Sensei, your manuscript!

00:12:53.790 --> 00:12:57.460
You never told me! You never told me
this commercial has a kissing scene!

00:12:57.460 --> 00:13:01.800
I'm sorry, Sana-chan. Up until today,
when Naozumi-kun's manager said to me...

00:13:01.800 --> 00:13:04.550
Wow, when Sana-chan
and Naozumi's kiss gets broadcast,

00:13:04.550 --> 00:13:07.470
it's going to cause
another big uproar, huh?

00:13:07.470 --> 00:13:09.810
...I didn't know about it.

00:13:09.810 --> 00:13:13.810
You didn't know? When you accepted this job,
didn't you check, Rei-kun!?

00:13:13.810 --> 00:13:15.810
Well, I...

00:13:15.810 --> 00:13:17.480
What would you like
to eat right now?

00:13:17.480 --> 00:13:19.150
That African dish, couscous.

00:13:19.150 --> 00:13:20.480
What's your favorite
color right now?

00:13:20.480 --> 00:13:22.480
The bright yellow color
preferred by Echigoya.

00:13:22.480 --> 00:13:23.820
What song would you like
to sing right now?

00:13:23.820 --> 00:13:27.160
"Oh, Vreneli"

00:13:27.160 --> 00:13:29.490
Right now, you are so carried away
with your Christmas date,

00:13:29.490 --> 00:13:31.580
that you've been super-sloppy
about checking your work.

00:13:34.410 --> 00:13:35.750
Rei-kun!

00:13:35.750 --> 00:13:38.080
I- I'm sorry,
Sana-chan!

00:13:38.080 --> 00:13:42.170
If his manager knew about it, does that mean
Naozumi-kun also knew about it?

00:13:44.760 --> 00:13:48.090
Mm-hmm! I'm looking forward to it,
you know? You know? You know?

00:13:48.090 --> 00:13:51.430
And I answered him
so gleefully...

00:13:51.430 --> 00:13:55.520
Still, I tried to do something
about this, myself.

00:13:55.520 --> 00:13:58.770
"Once again, this is who
Director Tarantaru is."

00:13:58.770 --> 00:14:02.780
Tarantaru loves Japan's anime
and kappamaki sushi rolls!

00:14:02.780 --> 00:14:08.410
Um, this is about the commercial, actually.
Could I ask you not to do the kissing scene?

00:14:11.450 --> 00:14:14.240
A kiss is just a way of saying hello.
It doesn't mean anything.

00:14:16.120 --> 00:14:17.460
Yes, but...

00:14:17.460 --> 00:14:21.790
Tarantaru does not compromise!
I strive to make the finest art.

00:14:21.790 --> 00:14:25.460
--Can't you do something?
--Mm-mm, I'm not listening.

00:14:25.460 --> 00:14:27.800
What an utterly
weird American.

00:14:27.800 --> 00:14:31.760
In other words, you made an effort,
but to no avail.

00:14:31.760 --> 00:14:33.060
Yes.

00:14:33.060 --> 00:14:38.060
First Asasko, now Sana-chan!
Damn you, kissing scenes!

00:14:39.100 --> 00:14:41.110
I know! I'll make myself
look like Sana-chan!

00:14:41.110 --> 00:14:44.440
No, that trick got shot down before, too!
At this rate, as a manager, I'm a-

00:14:44.440 --> 00:14:47.110
Reject! Reject!

00:14:47.110 --> 00:14:49.780
You don't have to worry
about it, Rei-kun.

00:14:49.780 --> 00:14:53.450
A kissing scene
is no big deal, after all.

00:14:53.450 --> 00:14:57.750
Though, when I first heard about it,
I did feel a little shaken.

00:14:57.750 --> 00:14:59.290
But then, now that
I think about it,

00:14:59.290 --> 00:15:01.790
--kissing scenes are just
part of the job, aren't they?
--Sana-chan...

00:15:01.790 --> 00:15:03.460
And, as part of the job,
I've been...

00:15:03.460 --> 00:15:04.750
...an octopus,
relaxing by the sea...

00:15:04.750 --> 00:15:06.130
...a Yankee girl...

00:15:06.130 --> 00:15:07.760
...a dine-and-dash lady...

00:15:07.760 --> 00:15:08.920
...a pushy old hawker...

00:15:08.920 --> 00:15:11.800
...a mysterious alien of the planet
Harehore from points unknown...

00:15:11.800 --> 00:15:15.470
...and so on. I've had a bunch of roles
while doing skits on "Child's Toy," right?

00:15:15.470 --> 00:15:17.640
So, when I think about
how I really don't dine and dash,

00:15:17.640 --> 00:15:19.810
and how I'm not
a Harehore alien,

00:15:19.810 --> 00:15:22.900
doing a kissing scene doesn't seem like
anything to make such a big fuss over,

00:15:22.900 --> 00:15:24.770
--does it?
--Sana-chan!

00:15:24.770 --> 00:15:28.150
I mean it.

00:15:28.150 --> 00:15:30.150
A kiss, huh?

00:15:30.150 --> 00:15:32.910
The one back then
was a terrible shock,

00:15:32.910 --> 00:15:35.740
but that was something one-sided
that Hayama did on his own, after all.

00:15:35.740 --> 00:15:38.080
It might not have been
my first kiss.

00:15:45.420 --> 00:15:48.420
When I say I'll be kissing her, it will be
a kissing scene that's part of our job.

00:15:48.420 --> 00:15:49.420
Ohh...

00:15:49.420 --> 00:15:54.090
But a kiss is still a kiss. Hayama-kun,
you forced your kiss on her, right?

00:15:54.090 --> 00:15:58.100
Mine might be for work, but Sana-chan
said she was looking forward to it.

00:15:58.100 --> 00:15:59.680
You're kidding!

00:16:01.440 --> 00:16:03.980
Which kiss do you think
is worth more?

00:16:07.770 --> 00:16:09.780
Natsumi...

00:16:09.780 --> 00:16:12.450
Have you ever been kissed?

00:16:12.450 --> 00:16:14.450
Why would you ask me that
right out of the blue!?

00:16:14.450 --> 00:16:17.370
It must be tough
being an actress.

00:16:17.370 --> 00:16:20.540
I hear that Kurata has a kissing scene
in one of her commercials.

00:16:22.790 --> 00:16:23.960
Father...

00:16:27.790 --> 00:16:29.130
P- Pop...

00:16:29.130 --> 00:16:31.720
Ooh, you're crying,
Father Hayama.

00:16:31.720 --> 00:16:39.140
"Down with Sana-chan kissing scenes!"

00:16:31.720 --> 00:16:36.220
F- Father absolutely forbids it.
To protect our pure, adorable Sana-chan,

00:16:36.220 --> 00:16:39.100
I am going to start a petition drive
with the neighborhood association.

00:16:44.390 --> 00:16:46.400
You're not upset about this?

00:16:46.400 --> 00:16:47.730
About what?

00:16:47.730 --> 00:16:48.900
Nothing.

00:16:55.070 --> 00:16:56.160
What!?

00:16:56.070 --> 00:16:56.160
"A kiss, huh..."

00:16:56.740 --> 00:16:57.740
Good morning!

00:16:57.740 --> 00:16:59.080
We heard,
Sana-chan.

00:16:59.080 --> 00:17:00.740
You're going to shoot
a kissing scene?

00:17:00.740 --> 00:17:03.410
Whoa, how do you
already know about it?

00:17:03.410 --> 00:17:04.750
You blabbermouth.

00:17:04.750 --> 00:17:08.090
Well, I can't keep anything
from Aya-chan, after all.

00:17:08.090 --> 00:17:11.090
Are you okay? Isn't doing
a kissing scene kind of icky?

00:17:11.090 --> 00:17:14.760
Oh, dear, what are you talking about,
you bunny? I'm an actress.

00:17:14.760 --> 00:17:18.430
Work is my life! Art is my life!
My face is my life! My teeth are my life!

00:17:18.430 --> 00:17:20.060
I've got a whole pile of lives!

00:17:20.060 --> 00:17:23.430
I can take a kissing scene or six,
and ba-bing, ba-bit...

00:17:23.430 --> 00:17:25.100
--You called?
--...turn them out like that!

00:17:25.100 --> 00:17:26.770
No, I guess not.

00:17:26.770 --> 00:17:29.110
She seems to be
enjoying herself.

00:17:29.110 --> 00:17:31.070
Huh, Akito-?

00:17:31.070 --> 00:17:33.400
Hmph, this is lame.

00:17:33.400 --> 00:17:37.240
--Still, with Kamura Naozumi as a partner,
I'd kind of like to try it, too.
--Hayama! Good morning!

00:17:38.410 --> 00:17:42.410
Hayama! What are you being destructive
without any reason for!?

00:17:42.410 --> 00:17:44.080
Hayama-kun is losing his temper.

00:17:44.080 --> 00:17:47.420
Well, sure. Sana-chan is going to be
kissing someone, you know?

00:17:47.420 --> 00:17:49.750
Sana-chan doesn't
get it at all.

00:17:49.750 --> 00:17:52.420
Sana-chan could be
extremely dense.

00:17:52.420 --> 00:17:55.260
"And so, shooting day
on the commercial finally arrives"

00:17:53.090 --> 00:17:55.760
Aah... a kiss, huh?

00:17:55.760 --> 00:17:58.760
Hi! It's Tarantaru again!

00:17:58.760 --> 00:18:01.680
I'm Kurata Sana!
I am not Sam!

00:18:01.680 --> 00:18:05.430
Kamura Naozumi.
Pleased to meet you.

00:18:05.430 --> 00:18:08.350
You two make a lovely couple,
just like in anime!

00:18:08.350 --> 00:18:11.770
Director, you're kind of
lovely yourself!

00:18:11.770 --> 00:18:14.440
Sana-chan,
you're hilarious!

00:18:14.440 --> 00:18:17.450
Thank goodness!
Sana-chan really does seem unfazed.

00:18:17.450 --> 00:18:22.120
Don't forget, the reason this whole thing
came about is because you screwed up!

00:18:22.120 --> 00:18:27.120
Listen up, now. Gangster Sana-chan,
you come in with your henchmen in tow.

00:18:27.120 --> 00:18:30.130
From the other direction comes
Gangster Naozumi-kun, the same way.

00:18:30.130 --> 00:18:33.710
Your eyes meet,
and then Naozumi-kun suddenly...

00:18:33.710 --> 00:18:35.710
...kisses you!

00:18:35.710 --> 00:18:40.720
Smack! Smack! I've already worked out
the timing of the kiss with Naozumi-kun.

00:18:40.720 --> 00:18:43.720
Sana-chan, you just
have to act naturally.

00:18:43.720 --> 00:18:45.060
R- right.

00:18:45.060 --> 00:18:49.730
Okay then, here we go.
3... 2... 1...

00:18:49.730 --> 00:18:51.060
Action!

00:19:09.750 --> 00:19:10.870
That's it...

00:19:15.420 --> 00:19:17.760
Oh, here it comes...

00:19:20.760 --> 00:19:22.090
Sana-chan...

00:19:22.090 --> 00:19:25.760
Here it comes...

00:19:25.760 --> 00:19:27.270
Here...

00:19:27.270 --> 00:19:28.390
it comes...

00:19:35.730 --> 00:19:37.730
No!!

00:19:37.730 --> 00:19:40.400
I can't! I can't!
I can't!

00:19:40.400 --> 00:19:41.410
Sana-chan!

00:19:41.410 --> 00:19:44.370
I just can't!
I don't know why, but I can't!

00:19:44.370 --> 00:19:48.700
Oh, no!
Please catch Sana-chan!

00:19:48.700 --> 00:19:50.710
I can't!
I can't!

00:19:50.710 --> 00:19:52.250
Sana-chan,
come down!

00:19:53.750 --> 00:19:54.750
--Sana-chan!
--She got away!

00:19:54.750 --> 00:19:56.040
Over there!

00:19:56.040 --> 00:19:57.050
Please wait!

00:19:57.050 --> 00:20:02.050
--She doesn't want to do this!
As her manager, I-
--I can't do it! No!

00:20:02.380 --> 00:20:04.590
I can't!

00:20:04.590 --> 00:20:07.430
I thought I wouldn't have a problem with it,
since it was a kiss for work,

00:20:07.430 --> 00:20:10.430
but for some reason,
I can't! I can't! I can't!

00:20:10.430 --> 00:20:15.060
Oh, Sana-chan, do Japanese girls
not like a kiss on the cheek?

00:20:15.060 --> 00:20:17.440
That's right!
A kiss on the cheek is-

00:20:17.440 --> 00:20:18.730
On the cheek?

00:20:18.730 --> 00:20:21.450
T- the kiss is on the cheek?

00:20:21.450 --> 00:20:23.410
Not on the lips!?

00:20:23.410 --> 00:20:29.410
Of course not, Sana-chan! For my part,
if he had told me it was on the lips...

00:20:31.040 --> 00:20:34.370
H- hey, Naozumi!

00:20:34.370 --> 00:20:36.040
O- on the cheek, huh?

00:20:36.040 --> 00:20:39.710
Yeah, they just said it was a kiss,
so I was sure they meant a usual kiss...

00:20:39.710 --> 00:20:41.380
Rei-kun...

00:20:41.380 --> 00:20:44.050
You didn't make sure
to check again, did you?

00:20:44.050 --> 00:20:46.720
Manager reject!!

00:20:46.720 --> 00:20:48.140
"In that case, okay"

00:20:46.720 --> 00:20:48.180
Oh, is that all?

00:20:56.730 --> 00:21:00.780
This week's Sana-chan.
No kiss, though.

00:21:19.420 --> 00:21:23.090
What do you want,
calling me out here?

00:21:23.090 --> 00:21:27.050
I just suddenly wanted to see your face,
Hayama, that's all.

00:21:29.430 --> 00:21:30.600
You know what?

00:21:32.770 --> 00:21:35.270
It was on the cheek.

00:21:35.270 --> 00:21:37.940
The kissing scene
was done on the cheek.

00:21:40.770 --> 00:21:43.780
And?

00:21:43.780 --> 00:21:46.450
Why would you tell me
something like that?

00:21:46.450 --> 00:21:48.660
Oh, come to think of it,
why would I?

00:21:48.700 --> 00:21:51.120
There's no need for me
to tell you about that, huh?

00:21:51.120 --> 00:21:52.790
What are you,
an idiot?

00:21:52.790 --> 00:21:54.290
Idiot?

00:21:54.290 --> 00:21:56.460
You decided it was on the lips
all on your own, right?

00:21:56.460 --> 00:21:58.790
You're an idiot.
Idiot, idiot.

00:21:58.790 --> 00:22:00.790
A big idiot.

00:22:00.790 --> 00:22:03.130
You'd call me that!?

00:22:03.130 --> 00:22:04.800
Whoops.

00:22:04.800 --> 00:22:06.800
I give up!

00:22:06.800 --> 00:22:09.720
And after I came
all the way out here!

00:22:09.720 --> 00:22:11.560
I could say
the same to you.

00:22:16.480 --> 00:22:19.810
Even though it was work,
I kissed her on the cheek.

00:22:19.810 --> 00:22:23.900
I've moved one step closer!
Sana-chan, I'm sure of myself!

00:22:40.750 --> 00:22:42.250
"Back against the wall."

00:22:42.750 --> 00:22:47.760
That's what you say about times like these.

00:22:49.010 --> 00:22:52.510
In dire straits,

00:22:53.260 --> 00:22:56.100
I've been waiting for an answer.

00:22:56.600 --> 00:22:59.980
My confessions are worked out
long in advance,

00:23:00.940 --> 00:23:05.070
to always go along with the scenario.

00:23:05.280 --> 00:23:11.110
My heart may be settled, but my mind is in a...

00:23:11.320 --> 00:23:13.280
...panic!!

00:23:14.280 --> 00:23:19.120
When my friends invite me by, suddenly,

00:23:19.330 --> 00:23:21.830
he's there.

00:23:22.750 --> 00:23:25.090
And our usual classroom...

00:23:25.300 --> 00:23:27.710
...quick-changes into a merry-go-round...

00:23:27.800 --> 00:23:30.220
...for two.

00:23:31.050 --> 00:23:33.680
Although I've said nothing but wisecracks...

00:23:33.890 --> 00:23:38.430
...up to now, just for today,

00:23:39.350 --> 00:23:42.020
I'm going to be honest and sincere,

00:23:42.230 --> 00:23:46.730
so BOY, take a look my way!

00:23:47.650 --> 00:23:52.320
When my friends invite me by, suddenly,

00:23:52.490 --> 00:23:54.990
he's there,

00:23:55.910 --> 00:23:58.120
And our usual classroom...

00:23:58.410 --> 00:24:00.750
...quick-changes into a merry-go-round...

00:24:00.870 --> 00:24:03.290
...for two.

00:24:06.380 --> 00:24:09.380
Hoy! In Sana-chan's
next adventures...

00:24:09.380 --> 00:24:13.390
Merry, merry, very, very Christmas!
Middle happy birthday!

00:24:13.390 --> 00:24:17.060
It's here! The middle birthday
that Hayama and I have been waiting for!

00:24:17.060 --> 00:24:21.060
Hey, Hayama, you made sure to get
a present ready for me, right?

00:24:21.060 --> 00:24:23.730
Next time on Kodomo
no Omocha, Episode 38;

00:24:23.730 --> 00:24:27.230
something will happen on Christmas Eve.
What on earth could it be?

00:24:27.230 --> 00:24:31.740
A Heart-pounding Kiss at Christmas

00:24:31.740 --> 00:24:35.240
Who will Zenjiro-chan's date be?
Will he even find one?
